<title>UK: ING Bank sets 100 million rand one-year bond.</title>
<headline>ING Bank sets 100 million rand one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Baring.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING BANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     16.125    MATURITY    19.FEB.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.80    PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-50-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/NL/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    50 BP     SELL CONC  50 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
